Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 23:59:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Delete accounts consistently; free identity for
 re-registration; auth rejects deleted users
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- DELETE /users/me now atomically cleans up the whole account: revokes
  sessions/tokens, soft-deletes posts/albums/comments/replies, removes chat
  membership + messages, cancels subscriptions both directions, clears
  notifications/settings/wallet/social rows, and frees the email/username
  (unique placeholders) so the same identity can register again.
- Register: duplicate check ignores soft-deleted accounts.
- Login: rejects deleted accounts.
- requireAuth/optionalAuth: verify the account is still live in the DB so a
  deleted account's access token stops working immediately (fail closed).

